    <div class="ed" data-rv style="--d:.1s">
      <p>We will serve women in the Denton County area.</p>
      <p>Our transitional house will be in a location that will be kept confidential. This is standard practice for residential programs serving women in crisis, as a means of safety and privacy for residents. For anything you need, our phone number and email are on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>

